[{"client_msg_id":"fcab0ac8-cfcb-4723-bd3f-c3f280c3a9f0","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"そういう問題が気になるので私はもはやfold使わなくなりましたね","ts":"1637643913.253900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"g2n4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8bd1489f-ec12-4f59-98fc-c80c643e22ed","type":"message","user":"U7HFY4HFY","text":"なるほど……\nとりあえず `:[range]foldopen!` でなんとかすることにします","ts":"1637643220.253300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7IFmK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ee7a1c46-decc-43e7-ab05-fa705a322d82","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"\u0026gt;  折り畳まれたテキストは、それが一つの行であるかのように、ヤンクしたり削除したり\n\u0026gt; できます。これは例えばプログラムの関数を並べ替えたりするときに便利です。\nとかhelpの`28.3`に書いてあるのでfoldがかかるのは仕様なんだろうな","ts":"1637642890.252500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fUpGR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9abe1d27-1455-40f1-a993-97e168fc7e02","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"helpに明記されてる場所が見付けられないけど`p`や`:put`でもfoldされるのでそういうもんだと思う","ts":"1637642581.251600","edited":{"user":"U9S4G0LJW","ts":"1637642594.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U7HFY4HFY"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VrJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"60722a07-84f9-4339-8a8d-682ae4b0213c","type":"message","user":"U7HFY4HFY","text":"インサートモードで`\u0026lt;C-R\u0026gt;\u0026lt;C-O\u0026gt;`でレジスタの中身を貼り付けるとき、貼り付けた部分が勝手に折りたたまれてしまうのって意図した挙動でしょか？\n1. `vim --clean` \n2. `:set foldmethod=marker` \n3. `i\u0026lt;C-R\u0026gt;\u0026lt;C-O\u0026gt;=\"{{{\\n}}}\"\u0026lt;CR\u0026gt;` \nこれで2行が折りたたまれた状態で貼り付けられ、その中にインサートモードでカーソルがある状態になります\n`\u0026lt;C-O\u0026gt;`の無い`\u0026lt;C-R\u0026gt;`だと折りたたまれないので意図した挙動でない？","ts":"1637642209.251100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NH9QV"}]}]
